<i>Худалдаа авах уу?</i>
269
00:23:52.808 --> 00:23:53.525
DESCIFRANDO...
270
00:23:53.725 --> 00:23:56.103
Alfa, Bravo, nueve, siete, Omega.
271
00:23:56.979 --> 00:23:59.239
