279
00:25:02.878 --> 00:25:03.962
Сартр.
280
00:25:04.546 --> 00:25:06.173
Жаспер 'JD' Drake".
281
00:25:09.092 --> 00:25:10.802
"'Todo es una droga peligrosa,
282
